{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52789","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 胡嘉鄢","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝乡辞宠命，羽服表华年。\n地变君臣礼，门荣父子仙。\n凤书开紫观，鹤驾待青田。\n归舸蓬莱近，宸章日月悬。\n迹光三乐美，声重三疏贤。\n即此过函谷，应留《道德篇》。\n（同前）（按：《全唐文》卷四○二有胡嘉隐，亦开、天间人，疑爲嘉鄢之昆从辈。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡嘉鄢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}